{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-fittle-box-weight-collar-slash-clip-2609-0074","content_id":"2ee26668-71ba-4f8c-8395-ac77d0a7870c","description":"Product Safety Report for Fittle Box Weight Collar/Clip presenting a serious risk of injuries.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"7e7c4537-6685-4b85-b7b8-bf80331b6c95","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-09-15T11:10:37+01:00","id":"7e7c4537-6685-4b85-b7b8-bf80331b6c95","title":"Link to product image and PDF ","updated_at":"2026-09-15T11:10:37+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6aa9199df1f8d2a39605f7d6/2609-0074-product-safety-report-fittle-box-weight-collar-clip.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Fittle Box Weight Collar/Clip</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of injuries because in some cases, the weight collars can fail to grip the dumbbell bar securely during use.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: Fittle LTD have launched a modification programme for products in \nscope of the safety issue. Affected users have been contacted directly with instructions on receiving a replacement collar.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Hobby/sports equipment - Sports Equipment Storage Racks/Holders</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Fittle</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Batch numbers</td>\n      <td>PI-MX251028; PI:MX-ST260112</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sales period</td>\n      <td>11 December 2025 and 7 July 2026</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>A weight collar/clip used to secure weights onto a dumbbell or barbell. Sold as part of the Fittle Box (a wooden case containing a dumbell bar, weight plates, and weight collars and clips).</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_7e7c4537-6685-4b85-b7b8-bf80331b6c95\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6aa9199df1f8d2a39605f7d6/2609-0074-product-safety-report-fittle-box-weight-collar-clip.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF </a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of injuries because in some cases, the weight collars can fail to grip the dumbbell bar securely during use. This could result in weight plates coming loose or sliding off, particularly under \nvertical loading.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>Fittle LTD have launched a modification programme for products in scope of the safety issue. Affected users have been contacted directly with instructions on receiving a replacement collar.</p>\n\n<p>If you have any questions or concerns, please contact Fittle at: hello@fittle.fit</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2609-0074</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Office for Product Safety and Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-09-15T14:28:41Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"hobby-sports-equipment","product_measure_type":["modification-programme"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-09-15","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-09-15T15:28:41+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-fittle-box-weight-collar-slash-clip-2609-0074","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-fittle-box-weight-collar-slash-clip-2609-0074","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-fittle-box-weight-collar-slash-clip-2609-0074","content_id":"2ee26668-71ba-4f8c-8395-ac77d0a7870c","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-09-15T14:28:41Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Safety Report: Fittle Box Weight Collar/Clip (2609-0074)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-fittle-box-weight-collar-slash-clip-2609-0074","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type","type":"text"},{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Serious","value":"serious"},{"label":"High","value":"high"},{"label":"Medium","value":"medium"},{"label":"Low","value":"low"},{"label":"Not provided","value":"not-provided"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_risk_level","name":"Risk level","preposition":"t